      "id": "rdls_exp-eurac_energyculturesdrivers",
      "title": "Energy Cultures Drivers",
      "description": "The information provided intends to support a profiling exercise of users' domestic energy use and how these variations are translated into different domestic energy-intensity practices across EU territories. This layer includes descriptive information on the energy demand dynamics at household level by means of taking into account the cultural-climatic aspects which characterise the EU climatic areas as part of this research. [Source: This metadata record was automatically extracted from the GeoNode portal eurac]",
